{"detail": {"templateUuid": "9976cd3e04cb4eccbea7eb41ccba94d3", "projectUuid": "613a1200d4c1495380754a35fd7e21d4", "name": "把东方美学，开进一支AI汽车广告。", "description": "中国汽车正在被越来越多人看见，但属于中国文化的视觉表达，还有很大的想象空间。除了传统意义上的“中国风”，中式哲学、东方美学与当代视听语言之间，或许还能找到新的结合方式。\n\n\n作为一个籍籍无名的小导演，以前很难有机会去尝试这样的命题，更不用说把脑海里的画面真正拍出来。AI的出现，让我终于拥有了更多创作的主动权，可以不受预算和制作条件的限制，把脑子里想要的画面展现成所有人都可以看到的影像。\n\n本片为个人概念创作（Concept Film），仅用于作品展示与创意探索，非品牌官方合作。", "coverUrl": "/assets/0e44a8a2ed709703.webp", "finalOutput": "https://libtv-res.liblib.art/upload-images/25add3bb1c0544618401d7ebfab0f071/27d71e49adf2320a4ef1611bac8b794fae3fb8f1.mp4", "snapshotId": 25313, "auditStatus": 1, "ownerId": 6808395, "ownerUuid": "25add3bb1c0544618401d7ebfab0f071", "avatar": "/assets/20048fe6bf4ba691.webp", "nickname": "走司机", "isLike": false, "likeCount": 237, "tags": [{"id": 3040, "code": "test", "tagLabel": "广告导演请就位", "parentTag": 0, "categoryId": 0, "path": "3040/", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 10, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 5}, {"id": 3041, "code": "test", "tagLabel": "1-创意TVC", "parentTag": 3040, "categoryId": 0, "path": "3040/3041", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 10, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 5}, {"id": 1101, "code": "product_show", "tagLabel": "产品展示", "parentTag": 1100, "categoryId": 0, "path": "1100/1101/", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 1, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 1}, {"id": 1104, "code": "creative_tvc", "tagLabel": "创意TVC", "parentTag": 1100, "categoryId": 0, "path": "1100/1104/", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 4, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 1}], "score": 0, "socialMediaUrl": "68 【以前拍不到的百万广告我用AI做了 - 走司机 | 小红书 - 你的生活兴趣社区】 😆 PIsV9zix5A2rCAZ 😆 https://www.xiaohongshu.com/discovery/item/6a4e24d60000000007012074?source=webshare&xhsshare=pc_web&xsec_token=AB--B2seHzyjIrE83VtkZGWONXXRZO4Ygefwkfi73jWMQ=&xsec_source=pc_share", "createAt": "2026年07月08日 18:29", "updateAt": "2026年07月14日 17:51", "publishAt": "2026年07月08日 18:29", "honors": ["创意TVC-提名奖"], "awardedTag": ["创意TVC-提名奖"], "